  cal-20261002-s7-074,s1,An iPhone sleep schedule sets bedtime and a wake-up alarm for chosen days.
  cal-20261002-s7-075,s1,"From Monday 5 October 2026, get up at the same time on all seven days and spend ten minutes outdoors before 09:00 on weekdays."
  cal-20261002-s7-076,s1,The worked example I write for Pynite could be the same model my page solves.
  cal-20261002-s7-077,s1,"By 9 October, write Hamming's list of the three most important problems in my fields and whether I work on one (80%, s6-011)."
